{
  "description": "Propositional inference engine — the learner applies inference rules (modus ponens, modus tollens) step by step to derive new propositions from premises, building a guided proof toward a goal. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
